    "title": "College Football Bowl Game Results",
    "text": "•\tMiami defeated Ohio State 24-14 in the Cotton Bowl quarterfinal.\n•\tOhio State finished the season with a 12-2 record.\n•\tTexas defeated Michigan 41-27 in the Citrus Bowl.\n•\tArch Manning was named the Citrus Bowl MVP.\n•\tIowa defeated Vanderbilt 34-27 in the Reliaquest Bowl.\n•\tUtah defeated Nebraska 44-22 in the Las Vegas Bowl.\n•\tDevon Dampier had a combined 458 yards and 5 touchdowns for Utah.\n•\tDuke defeated Arizona State 42-39 in the Sun Bowl.\n•\tDarian Mensah was named the Sun Bowl MVP.",
